   446	    *magnitude* ``|S| = sqrt(S_x² + S_y²)``; on MPAS we reconstruct
   447	    ``|S|²`` at cell centres via the Perot inner-product helper and
   448	    pass the proxy ``(S_x, S_y) = (|S|, 0)``.
   449	
   450	    Parameters
   451	    ----------
   452	    rho : (nCells, nlev) — in-situ density.
   453	    S_n : (nEdges, nlev-1) — tapered edge-normal slope.
   454	    mesh : VoronoiMesh
   455	    z_coord, jacobian
   456	    f_coriolis : (nCells,)
   457	    cfg_visbeck : VisbeckConfig
   458	
   459	    Returns
   460	    -------
   461	    kappa : (nCells,) clamped GM coefficient [m²/s].
   462	    """
   463	    S_sq_cell = _perot_inner_product_cell(S_n, S_n, mesh)         # (nCells, nlev-1)
   464	    # Tiny positive floor before sqrt to avoid NaN gradients at S²=0.
   465	    # See _gm_redi_common.py:154 for the analogous Visbeck N² fix.
   466	    S_mag_cell = jnp.sqrt(jnp.maximum(S_sq_cell, 1e-30))           # (nCells, nlev-1)
   467	    S_x_proxy = S_mag_cell
   468	    S_y_proxy = jnp.zeros_like(S_mag_cell)
   469	    return compute_visbeck_kappa_gm(
   470	        rho, S_x_proxy, S_y_proxy,
   471	        z_coord, jacobian, f_coriolis, cfg_visbeck,
   472	    )
