The surface-forcing bridge is still the documented architectural gap: prescribed/bulk diagnostics return `Q_net`/stress in `SurfaceForcingOutput`, but the combined driver only sums tendencies and does not feed those diagnostics back to KPP. I’m running the targeted guards now and will separately stress the sign cases numerically.
